  "notes": [
    {
      "type": "note",
      "title": "Router setup",
      "content": "Main router runs OpenWrt. DHCP hands out **.100–.199**; everything below .100 is reserved for servers.\n\n## Static leases\n- NAS — `192.168.1.10`\n- Proxmox host — `192.168.1.5`\n- Pi-hole — `192.168.1.3` (also the DNS server)\n\n## Restart Wi‑Fi without a reboot\n```\nwifi down\nwifi up\n```\n\n- [x] Back up the config to Nextcloud\n- [ ] Update to the next OpenWrt release",
      "pinned": true,
      "visibility": "shared",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T14:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-08T21:40:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "title": "Backup schedule",
      "content": "Nightly at **02:30**: restic to the NAS. Sundays: a copy goes offsite.\n\n- Keep 7 daily, 4 weekly, 6 monthly\n- Test a restore on the first of every month",
      "pinned": true,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T10:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "title": "NAS upgrade plan",
      "content": "Replace the two oldest drives first, then expand the pool.\n\n- Check SMART data before ordering\n- Buy drives from different batches",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T10:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-01T09:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "title": "Ideas",
      "content": "- A local DNS name for every service\n- Alerts from Uptime Kuma to my phone\n- Write down the power-outage recovery order",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-07-11T10:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-10-20T09:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "snippet",
      "title": "Update all containers",
      "content": "docker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker image prune -f",
      "pinned": true,
      "visibility": "shared",
      "created_at": "2026-11-08T20:10:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-08T20:10:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "snippet",
      "title": "Follow a container's logs",
      "content": "docker compose logs -f --tail=100 jellyfin",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T18:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-07T18:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "snippet",
      "title": "SSH into the NAS",
      "content": "ssh admin@192.168.1.10 -p 2222",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "shared",
      "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "snippet",
      "title": "Check open ports",
      "content": "sudo ss -tulpn | grep LISTEN",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-03T09:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "snippet",
      "title": "Restic snapshot",
      "content": "restic -r /mnt/backup/restic backup /srv/data \\\n  --exclude-caches --tag nightly",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-10-28T09:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "snippet",
      "title": "Proxmox: list VMs and containers",
      "content": "qm list\npct list",
      "pinned": false,
      "visibility": "private",
      "created_at": "2026-10-20T09:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-10-20T09:00:00Z"
